
@{
    ViewBag.Title = Resource.Privacy_policy;
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_LayoutMarketPlace.cshtml";
}

<style>
    .mt-15 {
        margin-top:15px;    
    }
    .heading {
        width: 100%;
        float: left;
        text-align: center;
    }
    .pp-inner {
        width: 100%;
        margin: 0 auto;
        float: left;
        padding: 60px 0px;
    }
    .sec-parts {
        width: 100%;
        float: left;
        margin-bottom: 25px;
    }
    .heading h2 {
        margin-bottom: 60px;
        font-weight: 700;
    }
    .sec-parts h3, .sec-parts p, .sec-parts ul li, .mx-80 {
        max-width: 80%;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .sec-parts h3 {
    margin-bottom:10px;
    margin-top:10px;
    }
        .sec-parts p, .sec-parts ul li {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
    .mb-15 {
    margin-bottom:15px;
    }
    @@media screen and (max-width:767px)
    {
        .sec-parts h3, .sec-parts p, .sec-parts ul li, .mx-80 {
            max-width: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
    }
</style>
<div class="container">
    <div class="pp-inner">
        <div class="row">

            <div class="col-md-12">
                <div class="heading">
                    <h2>Privacy and Data Protection</h2>
                </div>
                <p class="mt-15 mb-15 mx-80">Updated: 16 May 2024</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-12">

                <div class="sec-parts">
                    <h3>Overview</h3>
                    <p>Barrway is committed to protecting the privacy and security of all personal and financial information provided by our users. Our Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, share, and protect information in relation to our Platform, and your choices about the collection and use of your information.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="sec-parts">
                    <h3>Data Collection</h3>
                    <p>We collect various types of information through the Platform. This includes:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><b>Personal Information:</b> Such as name, email address, phone number, and address, which you provide during the registration process.</li>
                        <li><b>Financial Information: </b>Including credit card details and other payment-related information necessary for processing transactions.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="sec-parts">
                    <h3>Use of Information</h3>
                    <p>The information collected is used to:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Operate, maintain, and improve the functionalities of the Platform.</li>
                        <li>Process transactions and send related information such as confirmations and invoices.</li>
                        <li>Communicate with you about products, services, offers, promotions, and events offered by Barrway and others, and provide news and information we think will be of interest to you.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="sec-parts">
                    <h3>Data Protection</h3>
                    <p>Barrway implements a variety of security measures to maintain the safety of your personal information:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><b>Encryption: </b> We use SSL encryption on our Platform to encrypt the transmission of data, including payment and credit card information.</li>
                        <li><b>Access Controls: </b>Access to personal information is strictly limited to personnel who need access to perform their job functions.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="sec-parts">
                    <h3>Credit Card and Payment Data</h3>
                    <p>Credit card and payment data are handled with extra sensitivity:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><b>Payment Processing: </b>We use trusted third-party payment processors to handle all payment transactions. Barrway does not store your credit card information on our servers.</li>
                        <li><b>PCI Compliance: </b>Our payment processors are compliant with the Payment Card Industry Data Security Standard (PCI DSS), which is a set of security standards designed to ensure that all companies that accept, process, store, or transmit credit card information maintain a secure environment.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="sec-parts">
                    <h3>Data Sharing</h3>
                    <p>Barrway does not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer to outside parties your personally identifiable information unless we provide you with advance notice. This does not include trusted third parties who assist us in operating our website, conducting our business, or serving our users, so long as those parties agree to keep this information confidential.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="sec-parts">
                    <h3>Changes to Privacy Policy</h3>
                    <p>We reserve the right to update or modify our Privacy Policy at any time and for any reason. Changes and clarifications will take effect immediately upon their posting on the Platform. If we make material changes to this policy, we will notify you here that it has been updated, so that you are aware of what information we collect, how we use it, and under what circumstances, if any, we use and/or disclose it.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="sec-parts">
                    <h3>Contact Information</h3>
                    <p>
                        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or the practices of this site, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@barrway.com">[info@barrway.com]</a>.
                        This detailed approach to privacy and data protection ensures that our users can trust us with their personal and payment information while using the Platform.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
